Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,1,000 devices. One fleet incident.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.00,0:00:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,1,000 / 1,000 targets online
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.00,0:00:21.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,One prompt. No runbook.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.00,0:00:32.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,It samples first — then scales out.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.42,0:00:48.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,The all-at-once scan hits\NCodeMode's 60-second ceiling.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.42,0:00:56.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,It adapts instead of stopping.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.13,0:01:10.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,A timing probe finds the first degraded node.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.25,0:01:27.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,First 500: 483 healthy · 17 affected
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.25,0:01:37.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,The second half runs in bounded batches.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.45,0:01:51.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Full fleet scanned. The affected cohort is isolated.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.45,0:02:06.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,All 17 failures share one exact pattern.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.70,0:02:29.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Healthy canaries rule out the binary upgrade.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.37,0:02:52.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Root cause: canary-b pushed incompatible config.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.87,0:03:14.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Only 17 devices are changed — 983 stay untouched.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.87,0:03:21.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then it verifies the repair — and checks for collateral damage.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.73,0:03:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,17 recovered · 983 untouched
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.00,0:03:57.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,1,000 inspected · 0 still failing
